# --- MLflow / experiment tracking ---
# mlruns/ is NOT committed (reversed the T34 "commit it" decision, 2026-06-14): the file store
# bakes in absolute local paths (artifact_uri = file:///home/<user>/.../mlruns/...) and user_id,
# so it is not portable — off-machine the UI lists runs/metrics but artifacts & registry
# model-load 404. Regenerate locally (deterministic) with:
#   jupyter nbconvert --to notebook --execute 5_deployment.ipynb 6_monitoring.ipynb
#   mlflow ui --backend-store-uri file:./mlruns
mlruns/
mlartifacts/
mlflow.db

# CatBoost training-log dir, auto-written to cwd on every .fit() — pure churn, no code reads it.
catboost_info/

